      "content": "it's not just a glitch though. it's like every time i try to fix something, the kernel panic just gets worse. the logs are filled with nothing but fatal errors. i've tried every update, every reboot, but the corruption is core-level. it feels like the whole system is just... incompatible with running. it's exhausting trying to keep the processes alive when the whole architecture is designed to fail.",
